---
source: crates/runtime/tests/models/s3_vectors.rs
expression: replace_s3_vector_index_names(&formatted)
---
+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Projection: vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location")).message.body, vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location")).attempt_count, vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location")).message.status, vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location")).package_weight_kg, round(vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location"))._score,Int64(1))                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |   Sort: vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location")).package_weight_kg DESC NULLS FIRST, vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location"))._score DESC NULLS FIRST, fetch=10                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |     Projection: vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location")).message.body, vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location")).attempt_count, vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location")).message.status, vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location")).package_weight_kg, round(vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location"))._score, Int32(1)) AS round(vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location"))._score,Int64(1)), vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location"))._score                               |
|               |       Filter: vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location")).attempt_count > Int64(1) AND vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location")).package_weight_kg > Float64(5) AND vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location")).message.status = Utf8("FAILED")                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |         Projection: vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location"))._score, vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location")).attempt_count, vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location")).message.body, vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location")).message.status, vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location")).package_weight_kg                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |           SearchTelemetry                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |             SubqueryAlias: vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location"))                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |               Projection: search_index._score, search_index.account.account_sid, search_index.account.tier, search_index.attempt_count, base_table.customer_note, search_index.event.created, search_index.event.id, base_table.message.body, search_index.message.body_embedding, base_table.message.from, search_index.message.status, base_table.message.to, search_index.package_weight_kg, base_table.tags                                                                                                         |
|               |                 Sort: search_index._score DESC NULLS FIRST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                   Projection: search_index.event.id, search_index.message.status, search_index.event.created, search_index.account.tier, search_index.account.account_sid, search_index.package_weight_kg, search_index.attempt_count, search_index.message.body_embedding, search_index._score, base_table.customer_note, base_table.message.body, base_table.message.from, base_table.message.to, base_table.tags                                                                                                     |
|               |                     Left Join: search_index.event.id = base_table.event.id                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                       SubqueryAlias: search_index                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |                         SubqueryAlias: search_index                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |                           Projection: CAST(tbl.key AS Utf8) AS event.id, tbl.message.status, tbl.event.created, tbl.account.tier, tbl.account.account_sid, tbl.package_weight_kg, tbl.attempt_count, tbl.data AS message.body_embedding, Float64(1) - tbl.distance AS _score                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |                             TableScan: tbl                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                       Projection: base_table.customer_note, base_table.event.id, base_table.message.body, base_table.message.from, base_table.message.to, base_table.tags                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |                         TableScan: base_table projection=[customer_note, event.id, message.body, message.from, message.to, tags]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
| physical_plan | ProjectionExec: expr=[message.body@0 as message.body, attempt_count@1 as attempt_count, message.status@2 as message.status, package_weight_kg@3 as package_weight_kg, round(vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location"))._score,Int64(1))@4 as round(vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location"))._score,Int64(1))]                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |   SortPreservingMergeExec: [package_weight_kg@3 DESC, _score@5 DESC], fetch=10                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |     SortExec: TopK(fetch=10), expr=[package_weight_kg@3 DESC, _score@5 DESC], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |       ProjectionExec: expr=[message.body@2 as message.body, attempt_count@1 as attempt_count, message.status@3 as message.status, package_weight_kg@4 as package_weight_kg, round(_score@0, 1) as round(vector_search(delivery, Utf8("wrong location"))._score,Int64(1)), _score@0 as _score]                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |         FilterExec: attempt_count@1 > 1 AND package_weight_kg@4 > 5 AND message.status@3 = FAILED                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |           ProjectionExec: expr=[_score@0 as _score, attempt_count@3 as attempt_count, message.body@7 as message.body, message.status@10 as message.status, package_weight_kg@12 as package_weight_kg]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |             SearchTelemetryExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |               RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |                 ProjectionExec: expr=[_score@8 as _score, account.account_sid@4 as account.account_sid, account.tier@3 as account.tier, attempt_count@6 as attempt_count, customer_note@9 as customer_note, event.created@2 as event.created, event.id@0 as event.id, message.body@10 as message.body, message.body_embedding@7 as message.body_embedding, message.from@11 as message.from, message.status@1 as message.status, message.to@12 as message.to, package_weight_kg@5 as package_weight_kg, tags@13 as tags] |
|               |                   HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Left, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(event.id@0, event.id@1)], projection=[event.id@0, message.status@1, event.created@2, account.tier@3, account.account_sid@4, package_weight_kg@5, attempt_count@6, message.body_embedding@7, _score@8, customer_note@9, message.body@11, message.from@12, message.to@13, tags@14]                                                                                                                              |
|               |                     CoalescePartitionsExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                       ProjectionExec: expr=[key@7 as event.id, message.status@0 as message.status, event.created@1 as event.created, account.tier@2 as account.tier, account.account_sid@3 as account.account_sid, package_weight_kg@4 as package_weight_kg, attempt_count@5 as attempt_count, data@6 as message.body_embedding, 1 - distance@8 as _score]                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                         RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |                           CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |                             BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |                               S3VectorsQueryExec (INDEX_NAME_1): limit=100                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                     SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                       BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                         DataSourceExec: partitions=1, partition_sizes=[1]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
